# devices/unicorn/drivers/gpu/conf: the Xiaomi 12S Pro's GPU (and what else that file carries).
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_<NAME>=y in a defconfig builds a driver into the kernel (docs/drivers-config.md).

driver ADRENO7
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.adreno7.c
	requires GPU
	help    the Adreno 730 of the SM8475 woken step by step (adreno7=N), and kept on for HakiosGPU with gpu=1.
	help    The GPU, the GMU and the zap are the SoC's, so the 18 steps are the 12S port's and should hold; the file
	help    also hosts that port's panel brightness, its PCIe/Wi-Fi power-up and its TSENS reads, which are mayfly's
	help    and have to be split out (or checked against unicorn's tree) before this driver is unicorn's.
	help    Needs the GPU's firmware from the phone in fw-gpu/ (a730_sqe.fw, gmu_gen70000.bin, a730_zap.*)
